---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base lang="zh" title="产品体系 · ORDO">
  <section class="page-shell">
    <div class="container">
      <header class="products-hero">
        <h1 class="h1">产品体系</h1>
        <p class="lead">按规则能力组织：边界确认 / 责任事实 / 回溯事实。</p>
        <p class="intro">
          ORDO 的器具不是提醒系统，也不替你做判断；它们把关键规则落成可核对事实，让你在中断与切换之后仍能回到自己的判断位置。
        </p>

        <div class="chips-wrap"><div class="chips-label">快速跳转：</div>
        <nav class="chips" aria-label="产品家族导航">
          <a class="chip" href="#family-boundary">边界事实</a>
          <a class="chip" href="#family-duty">责任事实</a>
          <a class="chip" href="#family-trace">回溯事实</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      </header>

      <main class="products-main">
        <section class="section" id="tiers">
          <h2>一张图理解 ORDO 的产品体系</h2>
          <p class="muted">
            ORDO 以“规则能力”分层，而不是以功能堆叠分组：先把事实立在现实里，再把事实组织成场景，必要时形成共同语言，并以标准作为边界。
          </p>

          <div class="tier-stepper" role="list" aria-label="规则能力分层">
            <div class="tier card" role="listitem">
              <div class="tier-head">
                <div class="tier-no">01</div>
                <div class="tier-title">事实层</div>
                <div class="tier-sub">Facts</div>
              </div>
              <div class="tier-body">把关键状态外显为事实：你能看到、能回到、能核对。</div>
            </div>

            <div class="tier card" role="listitem">
              <div class="tier-head">
                <div class="tier-no">02</div>
                <div class="tier-title">场景层</div>
                <div class="tier-sub">Scenes</div>
              </div>
              <div class="tier-body">把事实组织为可部署的场景：阅读、工作、交接、复现等，不改变你的判断，只保留边界。</div>
            </div>

            <div class="tier card" role="listitem">
              <div class="tier-head">
                <div class="tier-no">03</div>
                <div class="tier-title">组织层</div>
                <div class="tier-sub">Orgs</div>
              </div>
              <div class="tier-body">把场景稳定为共同语言：在团队/家庭中仍能保持一致的边界与责任事实。</div>
            </div>

            <div class="tier card" role="listitem">
              <div class="tier-head">
                <div class="tier-no">04</div>
                <div class="tier-title">标准层</div>
                <div class="tier-sub">Standards</div>
              </div>
              <div class="tier-body">标准文本用于阅读与核对，不构成对任何产品的自动背书。</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="section" id="families">
          <h2>产品家族</h2>

          <div class="family-grid" role="list">
<article class="family card" id="family-boundary" role="listitem">
            <header class="family-top">
              <div class="family-title">边界事实系统</div>
              <p class="family-one">把“开始 / 暂停 / 切换 / 继续”变成可见事实。</p>
              <div class="tags" aria-label="适用场景">
                <span class="tag">阅读</span><span class="tag">写作</span><span class="tag">深度工作</span><span class="tag">恢复专注</span>
              </div>
            </header>
            <div class="family-mid">
              <div class="kicker">你会在这些时刻用到它：</div>
              <ul>
                <li>被打断后想迅速回到原位置</li>
                <li>任务切换频繁但不想重建上下文</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="family card" id="family-duty" role="listitem">
            <header class="family-top">
              <div class="family-title">责任事实系统</div>
              <p class="family-one">把“已履行 / 已交接 / 已关闭”变成事实，而不是提醒与追责。</p>
              <div class="tags" aria-label="适用场景">
                <span class="tag">家庭责任</span><span class="tag">照护事项</span><span class="tag">维护任务</span><span class="tag">协作交接</span>
              </div>
            </header>
            <div class="family-mid">
              <div class="kicker">你会在这些时刻用到它：</div>
              <ul>
                <li>需要把责任落到现实，而不是落到口头承诺</li>
                <li>需要明确“谁已完成 / 何时完成 / 是否可核对”</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="family card" id="family-trace" role="listitem">
            <header class="family-top">
              <div class="family-title">回溯事实系统</div>
              <p class="family-one">把“上次发生 / 上次确认 / 复现依据”变成事实锚点。</p>
              <div class="tags" aria-label="适用场景">
                <span class="tag">创作</span><span class="tag">专业工作</span><span class="tag">复盘</span><span class="tag">经验复现</span>
              </div>
            </header>
            <div class="family-mid">
              <div class="kicker">你会在这些时刻用到它：</div>
              <ul>
                <li>需要把关键依据留在现实中，便于回到同一判断位置</li>
                <li>需要跨时间复现决策背景，而不依赖记忆</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          </article>
        </section>

        <div class="divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="section" id="redlines">
          <h2>范式红线</h2>
          <div class="quote" aria-label="范式红线">
            ORDO 的产品不以监控、评分、惩罚、强提醒为成立基础。器具不驱动你做决定，只在你需要时提供可靠参照。
            <br />
            你不在场时它保持沉默；你回来时它仍然准确。
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .products-hero{
      display:block;
      max-width: 104ch;
      margin: 0 auto 14px;
    }
    .products-hero .lead{
      margin: 0;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.86);
      line-height: 1.8;
      max-width: 72ch;
    }
    .products-hero .intro{
      margin: 12px 0 0;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.78);
      line-height: 1.9;
      max-width: 80ch;
    }

    
    .chips-wrap{
      margin-top: 14px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .chips-label{
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.10em;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.60);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
.chips{
      margin-top: 14px;
      display:flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .chip{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(220,235,240,0.10);
      background: rgba(10,22,26,0.06);
      color: rgba(240,252,255,0.86);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .chip:hover{ border-color: rgba(220,235,240,0.22); background: rgba(10,22,26,0.10);} 
    .chip:focus-visible{ outline: 2px solid rgba(220,235,240,0.22); outline-offset: 2px; }

    .products-main{
      max-width: 104ch;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .section{ margin-top: 12px; }
    .section h2{
      margin: 0 0 10px;
      font-size: 13px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.70);
    }
    .muted{
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.62);
      line-height: 1.85;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .divider{
      height: 1px;
      background: rgba(220,235,240,0.08);
      margin: 14px 0;
    }

    .tier-stepper{
      margin-top: 14px;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .tier{
      padding: 18px;
    }
    
    .tier-no{
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.62);
      padding: 6px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(220,235,240,0.10);
      background: rgba(10,22,26,0.06);
      line-height: 1;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
.tier-head{
      display:flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .tier-title{
      font-weight: 720;
      color: rgba(240,252,255,0.92);
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    }
    .tier-sub{
      margin-left: auto;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.55);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .tier-body{
      margin-top: 10px;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.74);
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    
    .family-grid{
      margin-top: 10px;
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
    }
    /* third card spans full width to keep readable line-length */
    #family-trace{ grid-column: 1 / -1; }
.family{
      padding: 18px;
    }
    .family-title{
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 760;
      color: rgba(240,252,255,0.92);
      margin: 0;
    }
    .family-one{
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.80);
      line-height: 1.9;
    }
    .tags{
      margin-top: 10px;
      display:flex;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .tag{
      font-size: 11px;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.62);
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(220,235,240,0.08);
      background: rgba(10,22,26,0.04);
    }
    .kicker{
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.52);
      text-transform: none;
    }
    .family ul{
      margin: 10px 0 0 1.2em;
      padding: 0;
      color: rgba(220,235,240,0.76);
      line-height: 1.85;
    }
    .family li{ margin: 0 0 8px; }

    
    #families{ margin-top: 6px; }
    #redlines{ margin-top: 6px; }
.quote{
      margin: 14px 0 0;
      padding: 14px 14px 14px 16px;
      border-left: 3px solid rgba(220,235,240,0.44);
      background: rgba(10,22,26,0.10);
      border-radius: 14px;
      color: rgba(240,252,255,0.92);
      font-weight: 650;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .btn.ghost{
      box-shadow: none;
      border-color: rgba(220,235,240,0.09);
      background: rgba(10,22,26,0.06);
    }

    @media (max-width: 960px){
      .tier-stepper{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .family-grid{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      #family-trace{ grid-column: auto; }
      .products-hero, .products-main{ max-width: unset; }
    }
  </style>
</Base>
